1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Are you looking down while watching this video?

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:06,240
Let's dig into the shocking truth and perfect cure for text neck syndrome,

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,640
a modern disease caused by smartphones.

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,600
If the angle increases to a 60-degree steep tilt,

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,640
the load skyrockets to about 27 kilograms.

6
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,640
This is an immense physical shock,

7
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:20,640
equivalent to carrying a seven-year-old child on the back of your neck all day.

8
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:24,080
However, without lifestyle correction, treatment is in vain.

9
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,120
The Don'ts!

10
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,120
Lying face down using your phone,

11
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:31,920
or placing the monitor low and sticking your neck out like a turtle are absolute strict no-nos.

12
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,920
Now the Do's you must practice!

13
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,800
Align the top of your monitor exactly to your eye level,

14
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,400
and when using a smartphone,

15
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,760
support your elbow with the other hand and raise the device to your eye level.

